== Traveling To and From ==

The entrance to ST is found in [[Eastern Wastes]] at -7000, 0, roughly. <br>
The exit to ST can be accessed by being fully shrunk and using a [[Stalking Probe]] or other similar means of casting an eyeball spell while being flush against a wall. Then click on the exit spire. This is especially useful if you find yourself past the trapdoors where the exit is otherwise inaccessible.

